        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 901f35bc-5235-44b4-ad01-7a3518d60ee2).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47. Mr.Yoshi Sato, the head of Gama&apos;s janitorial department has placed a contract on Yuki Yamazaki&apos;s bodyguards after  they damaged the Gama Hotel&apos;s rooms,  failed to report contraband items, and threatend to start a gunfight with Gama security when asked to leave. Sato has asked us to eliminate these Yakuza and make Hokkaido a safer place. Please note that you will only be paid if there is no collateral damage. \r\rThat is all 47, I will leave you to prepare.",
